{
  "id": 8867095118023,
  "title": "Owl Patchwork Pattern Quilt Set, Animals Quilt Set Style, Owl Nights",
  "handle": "owl-patchwork-pattern-quilt-set-animals-quilt-set-style-owl-nights",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic elegance and a touch of countryside charm with this beautiful Quilt Set from Jeminise. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, it’s perfect for adding warmth and tradition to any bedroom, making it an ideal personalized gift for your loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Farmhouse Design:</strong> Features charming classic patterns for a cozy, timeless look in your bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift Idea:</strong> A perfect present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size, adding pillowcases, or including a name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat for quick drying and fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes 1 quilt, with the option to add 2 pillowcases for a complete look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from durable and soft Polycotton fabric for comfortable use.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
